1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
I learned it the hard way, in rooms just like these

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,780
That tomorrow's a promise nobody can keep

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:11,540
So I hold on too long every time that we part

4
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:15,140
Like I'm trying to memorize the beat of their heart

5
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:18,820
And I say "I love you" every chance that I get

6
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:22,740
'Cause I won't let a last chance turn into regret

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:26,340
No "I wish I would've," no "I should have called"

8
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:33,220
I'd rather say too much than nothing at all

9
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:39,060
So if you've got someone, don't wait for the day

10
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:42,340
Go hold them too long... anyway
